        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "language": "javaScript",
        "jsCode": "/* @include lib/views.cjs */\n\n// Claude sees the canonical master image and design record, and writes all four view instructions once.\nconst d = $('Prepare response').first().json;\nconst master = $input.first().json;\nconst ctx = d.claim.context || {};\nconst state = buildViewsState({ projectId: d.request.project_id, finalDesignId: d.request.final_design_id,\n  concept: ctx.concept, revision: ctx.revision, currentPrompt: ctx.current_prompt,\n  image: master && master.data_base64 ? { mimeType: master.mime_type, data: master.data_base64 } : null,\n  config: d.request.config });\nreturn [{ json: { state, request: buildViewsRequest(state) } }];"
